  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……ふう\r\n冬優子も、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "はいはいお疲れ様～……\r\nあー……今日は一段と長かったわね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "どれだけ撮っても完璧なふゆしか\r\n映らないっつーの……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……ま、撮れ高って点では\r\nカメラ回せば回すだけ増えますけどー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日も冬優子はすごく頑張ってくれてた",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あんた、もうちょっとちゃんと労えないわけ？\r\nテキトーにあしらわれてる感じがするんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、そうか！？\r\nそれはすまん……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当にすごいと思ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずーっとカメラが回ってるのに、\r\n仕事もレッスンもきちんとこなして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見てる人の夢を壊すようなことはしてないのに、\r\n冬優子自身の、少し踏み込んだところも見せてて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "密着取材に必要な素材は提供しつつ、\r\n見せ方をコントロールできてるっていうか──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふ、いい調子じゃない\r\nそのまま続けて？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当に、感心してるし、頼もしく思ってる\r\nさすが冬優子だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから──……うん、だからこそ\r\nゆっくりできる時にはゆっくりしてほしいと思ってる",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今なら、もうカメラは回ってないからさ\r\n遠慮なくくつろいでくれ、冬優子",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうだ！\r\n知り合いからもらったいいお茶があるんだよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "時間あったら、一杯──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……っふふ、あはははは……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？\r\n冬優子……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あーっ、もう……！\r\nおっかしいったら……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──ねぇ、あんた。もしかして",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『俺しかいない今の事務所なら、冬優子も安心して\r\n素を見せられるはずだ』──とか、思ってる？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nあ、ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そう。なら、よぉく考えてみなさいよ\r\nそれって、結構な自惚れだと思わない？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『俺の前では、ありのままの君を隠さなくていい』\r\nってことだし──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……！\r\n待った、冬優子っ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "なんでふゆが、『あんたとふたりだと落ち着ける』って\r\n思ってる前提になってんのかしら",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "～～～～っ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "自分のこと、ずいぶん高く置いたわねぇ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（言われてみれば、本当に……！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あああっ、これは……！\r\n結構、いや相当……！　恥ずかしいんじゃないか……！？）",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "確かにふゆは、あんたの前では\r\nこういう態度でいられるかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "でも、だからって\r\n『一緒にいたいかどうか』は別問題だと思うのよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それをまぁ、なんの疑いもなく……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった、わかったから冬優子……！\r\nこれ以上からかうのはやめてくれ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040210,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040220,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──じゃあ、ほら\r\nその、知り合いからもらったいいお茶？　だっけ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040230,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "淹れてきなさいよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040240,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "素のふゆに付き合ってくれるんでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040250,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……まぁ、ふゆ的には、取材されてる時のふゆが\r\n正しいふゆではあるんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040260,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──とにかく",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040270,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたの体を張った恥ずかしい発言に免じて、\r\nお茶の時間ぐらい作ってあげるわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003040280,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ありがたく楽しみなさいね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800304/1018003040280"
  },
